   "title": "Exterior Design",
   "intro": "The first thing you notice when approaching the FIRST 60 is her sleek profile, perfectly balancing the artistry and engineering behind this sophisticated machine.\nEverything has been pared back to the essentials, leaving only the elegant, timeless lines of Lorenzo Argento.\nAs you draw closer, the simple yet highly refined sailing systems reveal themselves—components that allow the owner to interact with the yacht seamlessly and with precision.\nFor those aboard who wish to enjoy nature and good company, the cockpit provides dedicated, comfortable spaces to fully savor the experience.",
