   "title": "Interior Design",
   "intro": "The interior of the FIRST 60 offers a spacious, refined layout, with every detail designed to enhance the pleasure of life at sea.\nBelow deck, a cosy dining area faces the owner’s corner, complete with a generous navigation table and sofa. The full-beam galley, with its elongated worktop and integrated storage, ensures effortless efficiency under sail.\nA standout feature is the owner’s cabin, which boasts a large walk-around, forward-facing bed, abundant natural light, and calming views of the sea.",
