  {
   "kind": "slider-design-pleasure",
   "id": "anchor_main-points",
   "title": "60 FEET OF JOY",
   "intro": "",
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "TIMELESS AESTHETIC",
     "text": "Crafted by world-renowned designers, she achieves a rare balance of elegance and practicality, while her dynamic silhouette results in a timeless, unmistakably First aesthetic"
    },
    {
     "title": "ADVANCED SAIL CONTROLS",
     "text": "Among its key innovations, the FIRST 60 introduces a captive mainsheet winch for effortless, precise sail control and adaptive helm ergonomics shaped around the sailor’s natural posture. The walk-around Winch Island centralizes all running rigging for secure, seamless handling, while the Park Avenue boom simplifies mainsail hoisting and lowering. The deck’s design balances speed with generous space, delivering a thrilling yet confident sailing experience."
    },
    {
     "title": "SPACE WITH PURPOSE",
     "text": "The FIRST 60 stands apart as the only yacht in her size range to offer distinctly designed, purpose-built cockpit zones for Relaxation, Dining, and Sailing. Each area is thoughtfully arranged to ensure comfort, safety, and seamless movement on board—allowing guests to unwind, share meals, or handle the boat with total ease. This clear separation of spaces elevates life on deck, creating a more intuitive and luxurious experience underway and at anchor."
    },
    {
     "title": "A COMMUNITY OF PASSIONATE SAILORS",
     "text": "The FIRST 60 is more than a yacht—it's an entry into a vibrant ecosystem of events, services, and a passionate owner community shaped by decades of First heritage. Owners receive personal guidance from the first configuration choices, expert support throughout construction, and Premium Service backed by 15 years of experience and over 200 yachts delivered.\nIt’s not just a boat, but a long-term relationship built on trust and shared passion—one that brings joy at its grandest."
    }
   ],
